POST {{baseUrl}}/api/today
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hoursAvailable": 5
}



### Today: try to skip ahead (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/today/tasks/{{task3}}/complete

### Today: complete current task
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/today/tasks/{{task1}}/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "timeSpentSeconds": 1500
}


### Goal history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/goals/{{fitGoalId}}/history

